     1112   define variable vss-include-info7 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1113   on help of frame Dialog-Frame
     1114   do:
     1115     run gbl/app_help.p
     1116       (input this-procedure :file-name
     1117       ,input ''
     1118       ,input ?
     1119       ) no-error.
     1120     if error-status :error then do:
     1121       message
